			<div class="content" id="post-content-4846044">
									

<p>I really vibe with both the core idea of the SCP and the start of the narrative you have here; though my concerns are two fold:</p>
<ul>
<li>Where does this story go? Like, what are you doing with this stalemate beyond pointing at it existing?</li>
<li>How are you telling this story?</li>
</ul>
<p>My concern is that it'd be very easy to write a short paragraph or two explaining the stalemate and then call the job done; and it feels like this is something that really needs exploration in a big, long form work that really like, lets the reader see what all the factions think and how they got into this uneasy truce to contain this thing; and like, explore both the politicking and the effect of the SCP on the world?</p>

							</div>

								
					
