<p><strong>Summoned via PM:</strong></p>
<p>Hi there Doctor Ramses. Let’s take a look at your concept.</p>
<p>So allow me to clarify: the scp is the demonic entity that is causing love to be lost in society, correct? The Valentia Protocol is… a ritual? enacted by the various GoIs to stop the entity? And finally, Valentine’s Day is one such… ritual? within the Protocol? Sorry, needed to clarify as it wasn’t very clear.</p>
<p>Nonetheless, I like this. You’re taking a real-world scenario / event / social issue and putting a speculative spin on it. My only concern right now is how you plan on telling this story? There seems to be many moving parts, so if you could briefly outline the page layout for me in a post below, that would help me visualise the article better. Do accompany each section with a brief description of the story (one or two lines, max) and its significance.</p>
<p>If you decide to revise the concept / respond below, do drop me another PM and I’ll take another look. All the best!</p>

